    "body": "STOPPED after the required clippy command failed twice.\nBoth runs of cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings fail at crates/app/src/operation/heights.rs:128.\nThe existing .map(&resolve) triggers clippy::needless_borrows_for_generic_args with rustc 1.99.1.\nThat file is unchanged from upstream/main 983f527bd7aab4f856666e62f0c06f381bc57474.\n\nTwo release measurements on macOS aarch64 both produced (4716, 4688, 549).\nBoth verified clean with no fallback.\nThe new exactness pin failed before the fix and passed after it.\nRestoring the old fallback made the strengthened pin fail, and restoring the exact macOS arm made it pass.\nThe heavy release test also passed with the exact arm.\nThe quick gate passed: 2 tests passed and 2 heavy tests remained ignored.\nNo NC or CL goldens changed.\n\nThe uncommitted test patch and decision file remain in .claude/worktrees/issue-2371 on issue/2371-macos-bore-triple in the local mkinney checkout.\nNo branch was pushed and no PR was opened.\nClaim released. The issue is free again.\n",
